## What Was Implemented

### New File: `functions/api/services/ai/openai.ts`

This file provides:
- `openaiChat()` — Send chat completions to any OpenAI-compatible API
- `openaiChatStream()` — Stream responses (for real-time chat)
- `getAiProviderConfig()` — Automatically picks the right provider based on env vars
- `assertAiRateLimit()` — Rate limiting (same as existing)
- `parseJsonObject()` — JSON parsing helper

### Provider Priority

The system automatically selects the AI provider:

```
1. If OPENAI_API_KEY is set    -> Use OpenAI-compatible API (Cline, OpenAI, OpenRouter)
2. If GROQ_API_KEY is set     -> Use Anthropic Claude API (existing)
3. Otherwise                   -> Use keyword-based fallback classifier
```

### What's Connected

All AI agents in your system use this provider chain:
- AI HR Interviewer
- AI Receptionist (public chatbot)
- AI Inquiry Handler
- AI Workflow Classifier
- AI PDF Autofill
- AI Marketing Dispatcher
- AI Autopilot (cron-triggered)

